sequenceDiagram
    participant SrcWorker as Source Inference Worker<br/>(GPU Pod)
    participant MXServer as modelexpress-server<br/>8001/TCP gRPC
    participant MetaBackend as Metadata Backend<br/>(Redis 6379/TCP or K8s API 443/TCP)
    participant TgtWorker as Target Inference Worker<br/>(GPU Pod)
    participant HF as Hugging Face Hub<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant NGC as NGC Catalog<br/>443/TCP HTTPS

    Note over SrcWorker, TgtWorker: Flow 1: P2P Weight Transfer Coordination

    SrcWorker->>MXServer: Publish P2P metadata<br/>gRPC P2pService<br/>Optional TLS + SA token
    MXServer->>MetaBackend: Store source metadata<br/>(ModelMetadata CR or Redis key)
    MetaBackend-->>MXServer: Ack

    TgtWorker->>MXServer: Discover sources<br/>gRPC P2pService<br/>Optional TLS + SA token
    MXServer->>MetaBackend: Query available sources
    MetaBackend-->>MXServer: Source list + NIXL metadata
    MXServer-->>TgtWorker: Source metadata<br/>(worker endpoints, tensor descriptors)

    TgtWorker->>SrcWorker: Direct P2P transfer<br/>NIXL/RDMA<br/>(bypasses CNI and server)
    SrcWorker-->>TgtWorker: Weight bytes<br/>(GPU-to-GPU memory)

    Note over SrcWorker, TgtWorker: Flow 1b: Cold Model Download

    TgtWorker->>MXServer: Download request<br/>gRPC ModelService
    MXServer->>HF: Fetch model weights<br/>HTTPS + HF_TOKEN
    HF-->>MXServer: Model artifacts
    MXServer->>NGC: Fetch model weights<br/>HTTPS + NGC_API_KEY
    NGC-->>MXServer: Model artifacts
    MXServer-->>TgtWorker: Streamed model files

    Note over SrcWorker, TgtWorker: Flow 2: Operator Reconciliation

    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant Operator as modelexpress-operator<br/>8080/TCP metrics
    participant OCPConfig as OpenShift APIServer Config<br/>443/TCP HTTPS

    K8sAPI->>Operator: Watch ModelExpressServer CRs<br/>HTTPS + SA token
    Operator->>K8sAPI: Create/Update Deployment,<br/>Service, PVC, RBAC,<br/>NetworkPolicy
    K8sAPI-->>Operator: Reconciliation ack
    Operator->>OCPConfig: Watch TLS security profile<br/>HTTPS + SA token
    OCPConfig-->>Operator: TLS profile<br/>(Old/Intermediate/Modern/Custom)
